OL,3,GNEWSAHarry Potter star takes on new
OL,4,Acharity role
OL,5,
OL,6,FHarry Potter and Game of Thrones actor
OL,7,FDavid Bradley has become the new patron
OL,8,Fof Birmingham Hospice.
OL,10,FBradley, who played Hogwarts caretaker
OL,11,FArgus Filch in the Harry Potter films,
OL,12,Faccepted the role after meeting
OL,13,Fpatients and families, as well as staff
OL,14,Fand volunteers.
OL,16,FDuring his visit, the actor toured the
OL,17,Fhospice's Inpatient Unit and Living
OL,18,FWell Centre in Selly Oak, a space
OL,19,Fdesigned to help people live well with
OL,20,Flife-limiting illnesses.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
